  refresh             Re-sync the active theme from stored settings (no data change)
  pglogin             Store Pasarguard panel API credentials (for theme switching)
  pg-diagnose         Print the Pasarguard template resolution chain (fixes a 500)
  diagnose [<url>|--auto|--json]
                      Adaptive diagnostic (zero-credential): discovers the real
